<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>cool</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Michael Clifford</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">cool</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7BicWDX4TJX09ps0XhNmrS</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.741" end="00:12.375">I'm standing in your shadow, I disappear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.375" end="00:19.086">While you're lighting up the room like a chandelier</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.086" end="00:21.987">Put me on and make me feel like I'm a new trend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.987" end="00:25.060">Skinny jeans, I don't fit in with your new friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.060" end="00:28.008">You're the only one I feel I gotta impress</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.008" end="00:30.994">Try hard and I wish that I could care less</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.994" end="00:33.809">Everybody knows that I'm out of place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.809" end="00:36.809">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.809" end="00:39.741">I don't look the part, I don't fit the frame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.741" end="00:42.814">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.814" end="00:48.931">She reads my mind, she knows that I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.931" end="00:51.688">Overthinking what I've been trying to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.688" end="00:54.501">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.501" end="01:00.085">I'm trying to play it off like I'm cavalier</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.085" end="01:06.567">Before everybody asks what I'm doing here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.567" end="01:09.747">It's kinda hard trying to fit into a new scene</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.747" end="01:12.720">When your clothes only fit in 2015</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.720" end="01:15.703">You're the only one I really wanna impress</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.703" end="01:18.705">Try hard and I wish that I could care less</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.705" end="01:21.491">Everybody knows that I'm out of place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.491" end="01:24.465">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.465" end="01:27.454">I don't look the part, I don't fit the frame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.454" end="01:30.501">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.501" end="01:36.647">She reads my mind, she knows that I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.647" end="01:39.371">Overthinking what I've been trying to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.371" end="01:42.408">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.408" end="01:45.528">I guess I don't see whatever she sees in me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.528" end="01:48.395">Confidence doesn't come so easily</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.395" end="01:51.501">When you're the guy who caught fire with the colored hair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.501" end="01:54.475">From the band with the song about underwear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.475" end="02:00.437">Nobody cares, they're unaware</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.437" end="02:03.234">I'm fine, I swear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.234" end="02:04.734">Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.726" end="02:06.392">Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.392" end="02:09.163">Everybody knows that I'm out of place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.163" end="02:12.186">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.186" end="02:15.158">I don't look the part, I don't fit the frame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.158" end="02:18.220">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.220" end="02:24.337">She reads my mind, she knows that I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.337" end="02:27.109">Overthinking what I've been trying to say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.109" end="02:30.167">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.167" end="02:33.085">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.085" end="02:36.085">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.085" end="02:40.085">Am I cool enough? Am I cool enough?</p></div></body></tt>